{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23259","headline":"和薛秀才寻梅花同饮见赠 · 白居易","name":"和薛秀才寻梅花同饮见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽惊林下发寒梅，便试花前饮冷杯。\n白马走迎诗客去，红筵铺待舞人来。\n歌声怨处微微落，酒气熏时旋旋开。\n若到岁寒无雨雪，犹应醉得两三回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}